<title>FRANCE: Carrefour April sales up 7.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Carrefour April sales up 7.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>April 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					14,910    up 7.9 pct</p>
<p>     - in France only			    8,541    up 4.0 pct</p>
<p>    January-April turnover		    58,896    up 8.4 pct</p>
<p>     - in France only			   33,332    up 2.9 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour SA reported its consolidated sales, taxes included, in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
